{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"production agent failure modes production agent failure modes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","fileName":"Production Agent Failure Modes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Production Agent Failure Modes","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"production agent failure modes production agent failure modes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","fileName":"Production Agent Failure Modes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Production Agent Failure Modes","heading":"Production Agent Failure Modes","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Production agents fail through context loss, weak planning, brittle tools, prompt sensitivity, and overconfidence. Truncation can remove the decisive error; long reasoning chains can become inconsistent; an API can reject a call while the agent assumes success; small prompt changes can shift behavior; and a plausible explanation can be confidently wrong.\n\nThese are logic and integration failures as well as infrastructure failures. Bounded context, explicit tool results, schema validation, timeouts, telemetry, and human review address different parts of the problem. No single confidence score proves the agent is safe.","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"production agent failure modes production agent failure modes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Production Agent Failure Modes.md","fileName":"Production Agent Failure Modes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Production Agent Failure Modes","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}